<p>You are the new Head of AI Platform and Security. You did not build any =
of this =E2=80=94 it was already running when you walked in. Your job is to=
 make the estate, meaning every AI agent and tool you run, safe, governed a=
nd accountable.</p><p>You do that through Antigravity, an AI assistant wire=
d into NovaSmart's cloud, which you will call agy. You state your intent in=
 plain English and it does the hands-on work.</p><p>The skill this lab buil=
ds is judgment: knowing what to ask, reading the evidence that comes back, =
and catching a risky change before it ships.</p></div></section><section cl=
ass=3D"section is-active" data-ctx=3D"2" id=3D"ctxsec2"><div class=3D"sec-h=
ead"><h2>Working with agy</h2></div><div class=3D"prose"><p>You lead in pla=
in English. agy does the hands-on work and reports back.</p><ul><li>You ask=
 a question the way you would ask a competent colleague. No commands, no sy=
ntax, no cloud jargon required.</li><li>agy goes and does the work directly=
. In this lab it moves at full speed and does not stop to ask permission be=
fore each action, so expect answers rather than approval prompts.</li><li>E=
very answer comes with the real evidence behind it: the actual catalog entr=
y, the actual audit log line, the actual configuration. Not an opinion, and=
 not a summary you have to take on trust.</li><li>Everything it does is rec=
orded, and anything it changes can be undone.</li><li>Long jobs run in the =
background and it keeps you posted.</li></ul><p>You can always follow up wi=
th "explain that", "show me the evidence" or "undo that".</p><p>One thing t=
o know about this mission: M0 only looks. Every step here reads, lists, com=
pares and reports. Nothing in your environment is changed. The fixing happe=
ns in M1, once you have decided what should be fixed.</p><figure class=3D"f=
